---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SteamDivider from '../components/SteamDivider.astro';
import testimonials from '../data/testimonials.json';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Our Story — KabirBrewCafe, Jin Bazar"
  description="Read the story behind KabirBrewCafe in Jin Bazar, Netrang. Wood-fired pizza, fresh coffee, and a quiet place to meet."
  currentPath={Astro.url.pathname}
>
  <section class="about-hero" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <div class="about-hero-bg" aria-hidden="true">
      <img
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1445116572660-236099ec97a0?w=1400&q=80"
        alt=""
        loading="eager"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="about-hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-hero-grid">
        <div class="about-hero-text">
          <h1 id="about-title">From an oven<br><span class="about-em">to Jin Bazar</span></h1>
        </div>
        <div class="about-hero-stats">
          <div class="about-stat">
            <span class="about-stat-number">2022</span>
            <span class="about-stat-label">Year we opened</span>
          </div>
          <div class="about-stat-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="about-stat">
            <span class="about-stat-number">572</span>
            <span class="about-stat-label">Google reviews</span>
          </div>
          <div class="about-stat-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="about-stat">
            <span class="about-stat-number">4.8★</span>
            <span class="about-stat-label">Star rating</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <SteamDivider />

  <!-- THE BEGINNING -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="beginning-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-text">
          <div class="about-year-marker">2022</div>
          <h2 id="beginning-title">How it started</h2>
          <p class="body-large">
            KabirBrewCafe didn&rsquo;t start with a business plan. It started with an oven &mdash; a
            wood-fired oven that a friend brought back from a trip to Naples, and a question:
            <em>why isn&rsquo;t there a place in Netrang that does pizza the way it&rsquo;s supposed to taste?</em>
          </p>
          <p class="body-small">
            The answer was: there wasn&rsquo;t. So we built one. A small space in Jin Bazar, a 
            second-hand espresso machine, and a menu small enough to fit on one page. The first 
            year was all word of mouth. The second year, word had spread.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-visual">
          <div class="about-image-wrap">
            <img
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1453614512568-c4024d13c247?w=800&q=80"
              alt=""
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <SteamDivider />

  <!-- THE FOOD -->
  <section class="section about-alt" aria-labelledby="food-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-reversed">
        <div class="about-text">
          <h2 id="food-title">Good ingredients,<br>no shortcuts</h2>
          <p class="body-large">
            The dough is made fresh every morning &mdash; flour, water, salt, yeast, and time. 
            The sauce is just San Marzano tomatoes, crushed by hand. The mozzarella is 
            shredded daily. Nothing comes out of a bag.
          </p>
          <p class="body-small">
            Same goes for the coffee. Single-origin beans, ground to order, pulled shot by shot. 
            And the margaritas? Fresh lime, good tequila, no syrups. It&rsquo;s not complicated. 
            It&rsquo;s just doing simple things properly.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-visual">
          <div class="about-quote-block">
            <p class="about-quote-text">
              &ldquo;Simple things, done properly, every day.&rdquo;
            </p>
            <div class="quote-footer">
              <p class="body-small">
                That&rsquo;s the whole philosophy. No secret recipes, no gimmicks. 
                Just a wood-fired oven, good coffee beans, and people who care.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <SteamDivider />

  <!-- THE SPACE -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="space-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-text">
          <h2 id="space-title">A place you want<br>to stay at</h2>
          <p class="body-large">
            The front room is warm and compact &mdash; a few tables, the open kitchen, 
            the oven glowing in the corner. Out back, there&rsquo;s a small courtyard with 
            string lights and enough room for groups.
          </p>
          <p class="body-small">
            It&rsquo;s the kind of space where conversations linger. Where the background 
            noise is clinking glasses and the low hum of the espresso machine. Where 
            &ldquo;one coffee&rdquo; turns into &ldquo;okay, maybe a margarita too.&rdquo;
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-visual">
          <div class="about-features-grid">
            <div class="about-feature">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="about-feature-icon">
                <path d="M18 8h1a4 4 0 0 1 0 8h-1"/><path d="M2 8h16v9a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H6a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V8z"/><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="4"/><line x1="10" y1="1" x2="10" y2="4"/><line x1="14" y1="1" x2="14" y2="4"/>
              </svg>
              <span>Fresh coffee daily</span>
            </div>
            <div class="about-feature">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="about-feature-icon">
                <path d="M20.59 13.41l-7.17 7.17a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0L2 12V2h10l8.59 8.59a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.82z"/><line x1="7" y1="7" x2="7.01" y2="7"/>
              </svg>
              <span>Wood-fired oven</span>
            </div>
            <div class="about-feature">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="about-feature-icon">
                <path d="M12 22s-8-4.5-8-11.8A8 8 0 0 1 12 2a8 8 0 0 1 8 8.2c0 7.3-8 11.8-8 11.8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/>
              </svg>
              <span>Courtyard seating</span>
            </div>
            <div class="about-feature">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="about-feature-icon">
                <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/>
              </svg>
              <span>Call to order</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <SteamDivider />

  <!-- REVIEWS -->
  <section class="section about-alt" aria-labelledby="reviews-title">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 id="reviews-title" class="reviews-heading">A few kind words</h2>
      <div class="about-review-grid">
        {testimonials.slice(0, 3).map((t) => (
          <blockquote class="about-review-card">
            <div class="testimonial-stars" aria-hidden="true">{'★'.repeat(t.stars)}</div>
            <p class="about-review-text">&ldquo;{t.text}&rdquo;</p>
            <footer class="testimonial-author">
              {t.author}
              <span>{t.detail}</span>
            </footer>
          </blockquote>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <SteamDivider />

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section cta-section" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 id="cta-title" class="cta-heading">Come say hello</h2>
      <p class="body-large cta-lede">
        11 AM &ndash; 10 PM. Jin Bazar, Netrang. No reservations needed for small groups.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Book a Table</a>
        <a href="https://wa.me/919909040194" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-secondary">Order on WhatsApp</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 55dvh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .about-hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
  }
  .about-hero-bg img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    animation: hero-zoom 6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
  }
  @keyframes hero-zoom {
    from { transform: scale(1.05); }
    to { transform: scale(1); }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .about-hero-bg img { animation: none; transform: none; }
  }
  .about-hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, oklch(0 0 0 / 0.65) 0%, oklch(0 0 0 / 0.4) 60%, oklch(0 0 0 / 0.55) 100%);
  }
  .about-hero-grid {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .about-hero-text h1 {
    color: oklch(1 0 0);
  }
  .about-em {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .about-hero-stats {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 32px;
    background: oklch(0.14 0.008 55 / 0.7);
    border: 1px solid oklch(from var(--primary) l c h / 0.2);
    padding: 40px 32px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }
  .about-stat {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .about-stat-number {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .about-stat-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: oklch(0.7 0.01 80);
  }
  .about-stat-divider {
    width: 1px;
    height: 48px;
    background: oklch(from var(--primary) l c h / 0.25);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .about-reversed {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: center;
    direction: rtl;
  }
  .about-reversed > * {
    direction: ltr;
  }
  .about-text p {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .about-year-marker {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--primary);
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .about-image-wrap {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4/3;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid oklch(from var(--primary) l c h / 0.15);
  }
  .about-image-wrap img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .about-quote-block {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--surface), oklch(0.11 0.008 55));
    border: 1px solid oklch(from var(--primary) l c h / 0.15);
    padding: 48px 40px;
  }
  .about-quote-text {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--primary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .quote-footer {
    margin-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid oklch(from var(--primary) l c h / 0.12);
    padding-top: 20px;
  }
  .reviews-heading {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .about-alt {
    background: oklch(0.07 0.005 60);
  }
  .about-features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .about-feature {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid oklch(from var(--primary) l c h / 0.1);
    padding: 24px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .about-feature-icon {
    display: block;
    margin: 0 auto 10px;
    color: var(--primary);
  }
  .about-review-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    max-width: 1040px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .about-review-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid oklch(from var(--primary) l c h / 0.1);
    padding: 32px 28px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .about-review-card::before {
    content: '\201C';
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 4rem;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--primary);
    opacity: 0.15;
    position: absolute;
    top: 12px;
    right: 20px;
  }
  .testimonial-stars {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }
  .about-review-text {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .testimonial-author {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--primary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .testimonial-author span {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .cta-section { text-align: center; }
  .cta-heading { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .cta-lede { max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto 28px; }
  .cta-actions { display: flex; gap: 16px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .about-hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; text-align: center; }
    .about-hero-stats { justify-content: center; }
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
    .about-reversed { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; direction: ltr; }
    .about-review-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-hero-stats { flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; padding: 32px 24px; }
    .about-stat-divider { width: 40px; height: 1px; }
    .about-features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .about-review-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
